        "heading": "Built by fans, for fans",
        "body": "<p>First Touch is an independent football culture brand. We're not affiliated with, licensed by, or endorsed by any club, league or federation — we just love the shirts, the terraces, and the matchday ritual, and we make prints inspired by that culture.</p><p>Every kit ships in Fan Version and Player Version, cut and printed the way you'd expect from the real thing.</p>",
